<title>USA: American Re approves Munich Re merger.</title>
<headline>American Re approves Munich Re merger.</headline>
<dateline>PRINCETON, N.J. 1996-11-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>American Re Corp said on Thursday that its shareholders approved Munich Reinsurance Co's acquisition of the company for $3.3 billion, or $65 a share.</p>
<p>American Re will become a wholly owned subsidiary of Munich Reinsurance, the company said.</p>
<p>The transaction is expected to close November 25, 1996, American Re said. The agreement between the two companies was reached in August.</p>
</text>
